Complaint

To: SHO, Vasant Kunj (South) PS, New Delhi.

Respected Sir, I am Kiran Bedi (mrs.), residing at C-9/12 Vasant Kunj. On the intervening night of 4th and 5th January 2026 my Maruti Swift, registration DL 10 CE 6045, was stolen from outside my house. I have parked it at 10 pm and found it missing at 6.30 am. The car had a FASTag and my driving licence. CCTV of my neighbour Mr. Arvind Kejri shows two men opening the car. Insurance IDV is about Rs 4,75,000. Please register case. Contact: 011-26123456 / 9999 888 777.
Kiran Bedi
